+ * wlanOnPostFirmwareReady -> wlanLoadManufactureData, txPwrCtrlLoadConfig;
+ * gl_init.c wlanOnWhenProbeSuccess -> wlanFeatureToFw), as on the GX4:
+ *   0x70 GET_SET_CUSTOMER_CFG "EnableDbgLog"   (connsysFwLogControl)
+ *   0x8A NIC_CAPABILITY_V2 query                (rottenapple_mtk_wfdma.c)
+ *   0x02 BASIC_CONFIG
+ *        MAC address: host side (wlanUpdateNetworkAddress, nicApplyNetworkAddress)
