+ *   0x49 SET_COUNTRY_POWER_LIMIT legacy + antenna      (rlmDomainSendPwrLimitCmd)
+ *   0x48 SET_NVRAM_SETTINGS (the 2048-byte NVRAM)
+ *   0x49 x2 again                                      (txPwrCtrlLoadConfig)
