+/*
+ * kern.rottenapple_wifi: read = 5 while Wi-Fi runs, 0 otherwise (also while
+ * starting or stopping); write 0 = stop (returns once powered down), 5 =
+ * start the level-5 bring-up again on its own thread (returns at once).
+ */
